[Music]  up to now legendary's procedure with  regard to the release of projects from  the monsterverse has not always been met  with sympathy from fans which is why  they will be releasing films and series  on several streaming services at the  same time in the future as was announced  recently disney is now also creating its  own series about king kong and the  notorious skull island however there are  not any references to the monster verse  and disney is rather focusing on its  very own story the script was written by  stephanie folsom who worked on projects  including toy story 4 and paper girls  and she is also involved as an executive  producer in addition to her role as a  scriptwriter horror icon james wan and  his company atomic monster are also  among the producers but so far there has  been no mention of the director we  assume that the disney plus king kong  series will be based strongly in the  original film from 1933 however more  details and a release date are not  available yet  with a recent decision by warner  brothers executives to scrap batgirl as  well as scooby-doo a murmur went through  hollywood and the entire world of film  many fear that even more warner projects  will be canceled as those responsible  around ceo david zazloff want to focus  on more blockbuster films and less on  smaller productions like batgirl in the  near future one movie that will  definitely not be dropped is the  upcoming sequel to the batman the  continuation is still in the works and  will certainly be released which is  great news for fans of the first part  director matt reeves is in charge of the  script along with matson tomlin who also  worked on the first movie and is also  the author of the comic book series  batman the imposter since the screenplay  is still in progress we cannot expect  any details regarding the plot of the  film anytime soon but we are still  looking forward to seeing what happens  next and we'll keep you posted  slowly but surely the release of the hbo  series the last of us is approaching  following some information and updates  about the series in the last couple of  months and weeks new footage is now  available in a preview from hbo max you  can see all kinds of series that are  either just getting started or getting a  new season among them is the last of us  which is particularly subject to  critical scrutiny among game players due  to it being an iconic game franchise the  story revolves around joel and ellie in  the starring roles we see the  mandalorian actor pedro pascal as joel  and game of thrones actress bella ramsay  as ellie in the newly released scenes we  get to see the two of them wandering  around in a snowy landscape along with a  few more glimpses of other characters  even though this is still far from being  a trailer many were happy about the  first moving images which definitely  make you want to see more so far the  responsible parties are aiming for a  release date in early 2023 but a more  precise date has yet to be confirmed  the long-awaited sequel to knives out  will soon be coming to the streaming  service netflix for a couple of months  we have known the official title is  glass onion a knives out mystery and now  we already got some first footage among  others we get to see fight club star  edward norton rapper and actress janelle  monae one night in miami actor leslie  odom jr one division actress catherine  hahn and of course lead actor daniel  craig as detective benoit blank  according to the official synopsis the  plot is about a new case that is  supposed to take place on the private  island of billionaire miles brawn while  friends and acquaintances of him are  invited for a visit a great misfortune  happens that only benoit blank himself  can solve by the way the title glass  onion is a tribute by knives out  director ryan johnson to the beatles who  also published a song with this title  glass onion a knives out mystery will  celebrate its world premiere at the  toronto international film festival in  september and it will then be available  for streaming on netflix starting on  december 23rd 2022  with henry cavill helena bonham carter  and millie bobby brown enola holmes from  2020 has a notable cast after mostly  positive reviews netflix is now teasing  the second part via its social media  channels the streaming service has  posted a first look in the form of six  images together with the release date  several of the actors are back along  with the starring trio new cast members  include wonder woman actor david thulas  four lines actor adil akhtar and hannah  dodd who is known from eternals for  example both the director and the  screenwriter remain unchanged from the  previous film in the form of harry  bradbeer and jack thorne meaning that  familiar crew members are relied upon in  terms of content the sequel picks up  where its predecessor left off so we get  to see nola's first steps as an  independent detective as well as her  first case which centers on a missing  girl hopefully as with the first part  the movie will be able to impress  especially with the chemistry between  millie bobby brown and henry cavill who  happen to be siblings in front of the  camera and nola homes 2 will be  available on netflix from november 4th  this week deadline reported on  production related news for the next  planet of the apes movie the blockbuster  which will be directed and scripted by  maze runner director west ball and josh  friedman is currently in the midst of  production and we now know who will play  the main role the talk is of it actor  owen t who will take over the facial  expressions and movements of the new  main character using the tried and true  method of motion capture sadly it is not  quite clear yet in which direction the  new planet of the apes will take that is  whether it will be a sequel or a reboot  we merely know that the new lead actor  and that the script is supposed to have  already been finalized in some way it  will also be related to the original  adaptation of pierre bull's 1968 novel  in contrast to many other installments  of the planet of the apes franchise the  film series was given a halfway decent  reboot in 2011 with rise of the planet  of the apes and as a result many fans  are in favor of a reboot of sorts for  the next planet of the apes movie west  ball for his part revealed on twitter  that caesar played by andy circus will  keep playing a role in the film we are  very excited and look forward to more  information about the new movie  last week said photos from the upcoming  disney plus series percy jackson and the  olympians popped up after filming has  only been running for just under a month  these are the first visual impressions  that have been made public after the  leak disney even followed up and shared  the first official image on it you can  see the starring trio consisting of leah  jeffries walker scobel and ariem  simandre percy jackson creator rick  riordan also recently spoke about the  movie adaptation of his books here  ryerton expressed his satisfaction with  production and even goes so far as to  say that he could not imagine the  protagonists without thinking of these  three actors in addition he is involved  not only as an advisor but also as an  executive producer and thus has a  significant influence on the production  which should delight fans of the book  series so far there is no set release  date for percy jackson and the olympians  but those responsible are hoping for an  early 2024 release  in 2020 ghost of tsushima one of sony's  best games for the past few years was  released on the playstation 4 primarily  the constant references to japanese  cinema and director akira kurosawa as  well as the breathtakingly beautiful  game world made the game created by  developer studio sucker punch  productions sell over 9 million units  within 2 years in its original form the  game in which you play the samurai jin  sakai is produced entirely in japanese  but of course it does feature  corresponding audio output and subtitles  the final movie is supposed to turn out  very similarly at least according to  director chad stahlski the john wick  director recently spoke in an interview  with collider about the way the upcoming  film will be made and it promises to be  extremely authentic due to his  connection to the japanese cult director  kurosawa among other reasons the ghost  of tsushima movie will be released in  japanese with appropriate subtitles  stachelski sees little issue with this  since western audiences are used to  reading subtitles anyway but that's not  all all the actors involved are also  expected to be from japan after all the  mongol invasion of the island of  tsushima which is the main subject of  the game was also a japanese affair sony  is said to be very much behind the idea  so it should only be a short period of  time before shooting starts there is no  exact release date for the movie yet  though given the early stage of  production we should not count on a  release in the next two years  well that was the news for this week if  you need more exciting infos we  recommend our latest original episode  about the upcoming super mario brothers  movie in it we take an in-depth look at  the production the cast and the possible  storyline we hope you enjoy it  [Music]

